---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/retail.css';
---
<Base title="Hail Damage Repair — Airborne Dent Repair" description="Paintless hail damage repair in Gunter, Texas, serving DFW and North Texas. Free estimates, lifetime warranty, we work with your insurance." nav="Services" css="retail">
<main>
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-panel">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Hail Damage Repair</p>
    <h1 class="display h-xl rv rv-d1">The Storm Left.<br>The Dents Didn't.</h1>
    <p class="lede rv rv-d2">Paintless hail repair in Gunter, Texas — serving the DFW metroplex and North Texas, and deploying nationally when a catastrophe hail event hits. Free estimate, lifetime warranty, and we work with your insurance.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Get a free estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-facts rv rv-d3">
      <li>Free estimates</li><li>Veteran owned</li><li>Gunter, TX &middot; serving DFW</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-figure" style="--hero:url('/img/card-hail-damage.jpg')">
    <span class="slot-tag hero-slot-tag">Customer vehicle &middot; Airborne Dent Repair</span>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
    <ul>
      <li>Free Estimates</li>
      <li>Lifetime PDR Warranty</li>
      <li>Master ARC Certified</li>
      <li>Loaner Vehicles Available</li>
      <li>We Work With Your Insurance</li>
      <li>Veteran Owned &amp; Operated</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">In Plain Terms</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:20ch">The Paint Usually Survives.</h2>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">Hail is the one kind of body damage where the finish normally comes through intact. The metal is pushed in from the outside, but the paint sitting on top of it never breaks — which means the right repair is not to fill the panel and spray it. It is to reach the back of that panel and work the metal out to where it started.</p>
      <p class="prose rv rv-d2" style="margin-top:1rem">That is paintless dent repair, and on a hail car it is almost always the better answer. The factory paint stays on the vehicle, there is no color to match, and nothing about the car's finish has to be explained later.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rv rv-d1">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">The Short Version</p>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div><dt>Estimate</dt><dd>Free, on every vehicle</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Warranty</dt><dd>Lifetime on all paintless work</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Insurance</dt><dd>We work with your carrier</dd></div>
        <div><dt>While it's here</dt><dd>Loaner vehicles available</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Gunter shop &middot; DFW &amp; North Texas &middot; national catastrophe response</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="border-top:1px solid var(--hair)">
  <div class="wrap sec-head">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Proof</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Damage Was Real.</h2>
    <p class="prose rv rv-d2">Every photograph on this site is a vehicle that came through our bay. Drag the handle.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ba-feature ba-half rv rv-d1">
      <div class="ba" data-ba style="--split:50%">
        <div class="ba-layer ba-before" style="background-image:url('/img/hail-01-before.jpg')"><span class="ba-tag">Before</span></div>
        <div class="ba-layer ba-after" style="background-image:url('/img/hail-01-after.jpg')"><span class="ba-tag">After</span></div>
        <div class="ba-handle"></div>
        <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" step="0.1" aria-label="Reveal the repaired vehicle">
      </div>
      <div class="ba-cap"><span>Hail damage &mdash; paintless repair, factory paint retained</span><span>Drag &rarr;</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap detail">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Detail</p>
      <h2 class="display h-md rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 0;max-width:18ch">What We Look At First.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="detail-list rv rv-d1">
      <li>
        <strong>Panel by panel</strong>
        <span>Every panel is assessed on its own. Hood, roof and trunk usually take the worst of a storm; the sides often come through barely touched.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Whether the paint is broken</strong>
        <span>If the finish is cracked or chipped through to the metal, that panel is not a paintless candidate. We will say so at the estimate rather than working around it.</span>
        <span class="chip blocked">Confirm: conventional repair &mdash; in-house or referral</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The estimate, documented</strong>
        <span>Photographed and written up per vehicle, so your carrier has what it needs without coming back for more.</span>
        
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Catastrophe response</strong>
        <span>When a severe hail event lands outside our regular service area, our teams deploy to it.</span>
        
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">How It Goes</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">Four Steps.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="steps steps-4">
  <div class="step rv rv-d0">
    <p class="n">01</p>
    <h3>Free estimate</h3>
    <p>Call, or bring it by. No charge and nothing attached to it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d1">
    <p class="n">02</p>
    <h3>Your insurance</h3>
    <p>We work with your carrier. You are not managing that side alone.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d2">
    <p class="n">03</p>
    <h3>The repair</h3>
    <p>Master ARC certified, paintless wherever the panel allows it.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step rv rv-d3">
    <p class="n">04</p>
    <h3>Back to you</h3>
    <p>Lifetime warranty on the work. A loaner is available while it is here.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="gallery">
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d0"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A black Mercedes-AMG GLE 63" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-gle63.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG GLE 63</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d1"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A Volkswagen Passat hood read under shop lighting" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-vw-passat-REDACTED.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Volkswagen Passat</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d2"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A black Mercedes-AMG G 63, rear three-quarter" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-amg-g63-rear-REDACTED.jpg')"></span><figcaption>AMG G 63</figcaption></figure>
  <figure class="gal rv rv-d3"><span class="shot" role="img" aria-label="A matte grey Ram TRX" style="background-image:url('/img/gallery-ram-trx.jpg')"></span><figcaption>Ram TRX</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<section>
  <div class="wrap sec-head lead">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Also In The Bay</p>
    <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1">The Other Three.</h2>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="others">
  <a class="other rv" href="/paintless-dent-repair">
    <h3>Paintless Dent &amp; Door Ding Repair</h3>
    <p>Door dings, creases and transport damage — no filler, no paint, lifetime warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/windshield-replacement">
    <h3>Windshield &amp; Glass</h3>
    <p>Replacement at your home or workplace, or in the shop. Your call.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
  <a class="other rv" href="/window-tint">
    <h3>XPEL Window Tint</h3>
    <p>XPEL film exclusively, carrying the manufacturer's warranty.</p>
    <span class="go">See the page <span>&rarr;</span></span>
  </a>
</div>
<a class="cross" href="/wholesale">
  <p class="eyebrow">Dealer, body shop or fleet?</p>
  <h2 class="display h-sm">Wholesale &amp; Fleet Accounts</h2>
  <p>Pickup and delivery, up to 25 vehicles a week, and the same lifetime warranty on every
    paintless repair we perform.</p>
  <span class="go">See wholesale <span>&rarr;</span></span>
</a>
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap final-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-olive rv">Gunter, Texas &middot; Serving DFW &amp; North Texas</p>
      <h2 class="display h-lg rv rv-d1" style="margin-block:1rem 1.25rem;max-width:16ch">Get A Free Estimate.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row rv rv-d2">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/contact">Request an estimate <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+16822260543">Call 682-226-0543</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-block rv rv-d1">
      <strong>Airborne Dent Repair</strong>
      <a href="mailto:airbornepdr@gmail.com">airbornepdr@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="tel:+16822260543">682-226-0543</a>
      <span>Fax 833-907-5267</span>
      <span style="margin-top:.6rem">Mon&ndash;Sat 9:00 AM &ndash; 7:00 PM &middot; Closed Sunday</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Base>
